  <entity00266961:DisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">마. 당기말 현재 연결회사는 금융위원회 혁신금융 지정에 따라, 연결회사 후불결제 서비스 가입자에 한하여 결제대금 부족분을 추후에 상환할 수 있도록 하는 약정을 체결하고 있습니다. 2025년말 미사용분(난외약정)에 대한 한도 금액은 211,375백만원입니다.</entity00266961:DisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsTextBlock>
  <entity00266961:UnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentLimitOfDisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsOfDisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">211375000000</entity00266961:UnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentLimitOfDisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsOfDisclosureOfUnusedOffBalanceSheetCommitmentsTableOfItems>
